        "description": "* WHAT...South winds 25 to 40 mph with gusts up to 55 mph expected.\n\n* WHERE...Delta Junction.\n\n* WHEN...From 4 PM this afternoon to 4 PM AKDT Saturday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree\nlimbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...The strongest winds will occur between early\nFriday morning and Friday evening.",
        "severity": "Moderate",
        "certainty": "Likely",
